WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
This is a C++ program for managing volunteers.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The code includes menu options and input validation.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
I run the program to check its output.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The program displays the available options and results.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
It processes the selected option and shows the information.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
The output demonstrates how the program responds to user input.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
The program continues running until the user chooses to exit.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.319
This completes the demonstration of the C++ program.
